# Allowlist for scripts/check-orphan-surfaces.sh
#
# One bare @Composable symbol name per line. A listed surface is exempt from
# the ORPHANED / DEBUG-ONLY gate — use it ONLY for a surface that is
# deliberately unwired (e.g. staged behind an entry point that has not landed
# yet), and note why on the line above it.
#
# An entry here is DEBT, not an answer: an unreachable surface still ships dead
# code in the release APK and still passes connected tests that prove nothing
# about reachability. Remove the entry as soon as the surface is wired up.
#
# Example:
#   # wired up by feature #NNN WI-3 (entry point not merged yet)
#   SomeStagedScreen
